/* ---------- one sale, followed through the day (times and codes are examples) ---------- */
const SALE=[
 ['10:14:02','The scan','Kuchanganua','The adviser scans a digital thermometer at the counter. In the same instant the catalogue returns the product, its batch, its expiry date and the single price that the store, the app, the website and WhatsApp all share. Nothing is typed, so nothing can be mistyped.','Mshauri anachanganua kipimajoto cha kidijitali kaunta. Papo hapo katalogi inarudisha bidhaa, toleo lake, tarehe yake ya kuisha na bei moja ambayo duka, programu, tovuti na WhatsApp vinashiriki. Hakuna kinachoandikwa, kwa hiyo hakuna kinachoweza kukosewa.'],
 ['10:14:09','The payment','Malipo','A mobile-money request appears on the customer’s own phone and she approves it with her PIN; card and cash work the same way. The sale goes through the till’s approved fiscal link to TRA and the receipt arrives by SMS or WhatsApp. Money, VAT and margin are posted to the books at the same moment.','Ombi la pesa kwa simu linatokea kwenye simu ya mteja mwenyewe naye analiidhinisha kwa PIN yake; kadi na taslimu zinafanya kazi vivyo hivyo. Mauzo yanapita kwenye kiungo cha kodi cha mashine kilichoidhinishwa na TRA na risiti inafika kwa SMS au WhatsApp. Pesa, VAT na faida vinaingizwa kwenye vitabu wakati huo huo.'],
 ['10:14:10','The shelf','Rafu','Stock of this thermometer falls to its reorder point. The system drafts a purchase order for one-tap approval and always sends out the first-expiring batch first. Nobody walks the aisle with a notebook.','Stoku ya kipimajoto hiki inashuka hadi kiwango chake cha kuagiza upya. Mfumo unaandaa oda ya ununuzi ya kuidhinishwa kwa mguso mmoja na daima unatoa kwanza toleo linaloisha muda kwanza. Hakuna anayetembea kwenye njia za rafu na daftari.'],
 ['10:14:11','The household','Kaya','The sale joins the household record of a Mama na Mtoto member. With her consent, her family can see that the thermometer reached her, and nothing more.','Mauzo yanaingia kwenye kumbukumbu ya kaya ya mwanachama wa Mama na Mtoto. Kwa ridhaa yake, familia yake inaweza kuona kwamba kipimajoto kimemfikia, na hakuna zaidi.'],
 [['Thu 07:30','Alh 07:30'],'The packing bench','Meza ya kufunga','Before her delivery day, the packing tablet lists her Afya Box from the choices locked on the 18th. Each item is scanned into the box, which removes it from stock, and the sealed box is photographed.','Kabla ya siku yake ya kuletewa, kishikwambi cha kufungia kinaorodhesha Afya Box yake kutoka machaguo yaliyofungwa tarehe 18. Kila bidhaa inachanganuliwa kuingia kwenye boksi, jambo linaloiondoa kwenye stoku, na boksi lililofungwa linapigwa picha.'],
 [['Thu 16:40','Alh 16:40'],'The road','Barabarani','The rider’s phone shows the afternoon’s drops in zone order with only what the job needs: a first name, an area, a phone number and a four-digit hand-over code. The rider never sees a health reading or a price history.','Simu ya msafirishaji inaonyesha safari za mchana kwa mpangilio wa kanda pamoja na kinachohitajika tu: jina la kwanza, eneo, namba ya simu na namba ya siri ya tarakimu nne ya kukabidhi. Msafirishaji haoni kamwe kipimo cha afya wala historia ya bei.'],
 ['21:00','The founders','Waanzilishi','The day closes itself. The founders receive one WhatsApp report: sales by channel, customers served, Afya Checks and referrals, new members, stock risks and anything that went wrong. One reply approves the purchase orders the shelf drafted that morning.','Siku inajifunga yenyewe. Waanzilishi wanapokea ripoti moja ya WhatsApp: mauzo kwa kila njia, wateja waliohudumiwa, Afya Check na rufaa, wanachama wapya, hatari za stoku na chochote kilichoharibika. Jibu moja linaidhinisha oda za ununuzi ambazo rafu iliziandaa asubuhi.']];

/* ---------- architecture: five layers ---------- */
const ARCH=[
 ['Touchpoints','Vituo vya kugusa','Every screen is a window onto the same record. Inside: the handheld tills, the Afya Check kiosk, the packing tablet, the rider’s phone and the founders’ phones. Outside: the app, the website, WhatsApp and SMS. They keep a working copy so they can sell offline, then hand every change back.','Kila skrini ni dirisha la kumbukumbu ileile. Ndani: mashine za mkononi, kioski cha Afya Check, kishikwambi cha kufungia, simu ya msafirishaji na simu za waanzilishi. Nje: programu, tovuti, WhatsApp na SMS. Vinatunza nakala ya kazi ili viweze kuuza bila mtandao, kisha vinarudisha kila badiliko.','Buy the hardware','Tunanunua vifaa'],
 ['The record','Kumbukumbu','One source of truth, written once: products and prices, stock by batch and expiry, households and members, boxes and orders, consented readings, staff and money. Every change is saved with a time, a device and a person, which gives a full audit trail.','Chanzo kimoja cha ukweli, kinachoandikwa mara moja: bidhaa na bei, stoku kwa toleo na tarehe ya kuisha, kaya na wanachama, maboksi na oda, vipimo vilivyoridhiwa, wafanyakazi na pesa. Kila badiliko linahifadhiwa pamoja na muda, kifaa na mtu, jambo linalotoa historia kamili ya ukaguzi.','We own it','Ni yetu'],
 ['Rules','Kanuni','Reorder points, first-expiry-first-out, the 12-day box lock, renewal reminders, Afya Check referral thresholds and permissions by role. Rules are settings, not code, so the store lead can change a reorder point without a developer.','Viwango vya kuagiza upya, kinachoisha muda kwanza kinatoka kwanza, kufungwa kwa boksi siku 12 kabla, vikumbusho vya kuhuisha, viwango vya rufaa vya Afya Check na ruhusa kwa majukumu. Kanuni ni mipangilio, si msimbo, kwa hiyo kiongozi wa duka anaweza kubadili kiwango cha kuagiza bila msanidi.','Build on bought tools','Tunajenga juu ya zana tulizonunua'],
 ['Connections','Miunganisho','Mobile money and cards through one aggregator, the TRA fiscal link, the WhatsApp Business Platform, the SMS gateway, the accounting package and maps. Each outside service sits behind one adapter of our own, so a provider can be replaced without touching the store.','Pesa kwa simu na kadi kupitia mkusanyaji mmoja, kiungo cha kodi cha TRA, WhatsApp Business Platform, lango la SMS, programu ya uhasibu na ramani. Kila huduma ya nje iko nyuma ya kiunganishi kimoja chetu, kwa hiyo mtoa huduma anaweza kubadilishwa bila kugusa duka.','Connect','Tunaunganisha'],
 ['Intelligence','Akili','Household forecasts, the 21:00 report, the founder dashboard and the investor pack. It reads from the record and never writes to it, so a report can never change a sale. Forecasts start as simple rules and become statistical models after twelve months of history.','Utabiri wa kaya, ripoti ya saa 3 usiku, dashibodi ya waanzilishi na ripoti ya wawekezaji. Inasoma kutoka kwenye kumbukumbu na haiandiki humo kamwe, kwa hiyo ripoti haiwezi kubadilisha mauzo. Utabiri unaanza kama kanuni rahisi na kuwa modeli za takwimu baada ya historia ya miezi kumi na miwili.','Build','Tunajenga']];

